the-firm-as-one-program-36 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-36 = unlines (cons "- **C13** Contracts, clearing and margin are rules over states ([P2: Programs, relations and their justifications in one language, with the reasoning kept as data (hyperactivity v31 §1–2)], [P6: Machines, operating systems and fleets as one program through composed handlers (hyperactivity v31 §7)])." (cons "  Master agreements, clearing obligations, margin terms, exchange membership rules and data licences are rules over states. A margin call is a transition, a clearing obligation is an effect with a scope, a collateral agreement is an invariant, and whether a strategy respects a data licence is a property that can be proved. The firm knows at every moment what it owes and to whom, and legal review stops being the slowest step into a new market." nil))
